OL,3,GNEWSAMan in 80s dies after village bus
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 80s has died days after
OL,7,Fbeing hit by a bus in a village in
OL,8,FLeicestershire.
OL,10,FOn 24 August, Leicestershire Police
OL,11,Fsaid officers were called to Melton
OL,12,FRoad, Queniborough, at about 15:30 BST
OL,13,Fafter receiving reports of a crash
OL,14,Finvolving a pedestrian and a bus.
OL,16,FThe man was taken to hospital but died
OL,17,Fof his injuries on Tuesday, a force
OL,18,Fstatement said.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
